  "prefLabel": "En 1008.02 Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1008.02 Application. An applicant shall submit a complete application with the fee pursuant to En 1004.01, which shall be sent electronically pursuant to each utility’s instructions. Separate from and in addition to the application fee described in En 1004.01, the applicant shall submit a fee for fast track review. The fast track review fee shall be utility specific and designed to recover all costs associated with the fast track review process, shall be based upon the applicant’s facility export capacity, and may consist of a fixed fee in whole or in part.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
